@startuml

package "Frontend" as Frontend
package "API-Gateway" as APIGateway
package "Orchestrator" as Orchestrator
package "External-Service" as ExternalService
package "BookScheduler_MQTT" as BookScheduler
package "edge-mqtt" as EdgeMQTT

Frontend --> APIGateway : HTTP/REST
Frontend --> ExternalService : HTTP/REST (optional)

APIGateway --> Orchestrator : Service calls
APIGateway --> ExternalService : Direct API calls

Orchestrator --> ExternalService : Business operations
Orchestrator --> BookScheduler : Scheduling / messaging

BookScheduler --> EdgeMQTT : MQTT communication

@enduml
